      "message": "tests: don't define the ellswift exhaustive test for even-order curves\n\nWith group order 7, the curve has even order and test_exhaustive_ellswift\nis defined but never called, which gives an unused-function warning.\nInclude it only where it is called.\n\nAssisted-by: my usual tools (LLM, Internet, computer). Mistakes are mine.\nSigned-off-by: Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net>",
