      ],
      "message": "ci: run exhaustive_tests for group orders 7 and 199\n\nCI built exhaustive_tests only for its default group order, 13, so\norders 7 and 199 were never compiled. Order 7 is the even-order curve,\nfor which the ellswift tests are skipped.\n\nci.sh rebuilds exhaustive_tests for the group order in\nEXHAUSTIVE_TEST_ORDER and runs it with EXHAUSTIVE_TEST_ARGS. Two new rows\nuse it. Order 199 runs one part in 20000 of the tests, because the\nwhole run would take weeks.\n\nAssisted-by: my usual tools (LLM, Internet, computer). Mistakes are mine.\nSigned-off-by: Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net>",
